WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.150
Earth's temperature settles where energy out equals energy in.

2
00:00:05.055 --> 00:00:09.080
Energy in equals energy out, so the temperature stays steady.

3
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.230
With more sunlight, energy in is bigger than energy out.

4
00:00:19.608 --> 00:00:24.058
Earth warms until the infrared it gives off catches up: a new balance.
